{"script":"yd_005_05-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":280,"y":-297,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":280,"transTime":300,"y":-297,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]哦，你也听到那些家伙们说的话了？[r][l]我倒有些好奇你是如何评价的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]唉……如果老板你也经常做超出分外的工作，就会理解我的态度为何如此。[r][l]当然这并不算抱怨。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]工作之外的时间，我除了休息没什么别的需求，为什么还要刻意摆好脸给所有人看呢？[r][l]你说对吧，老板？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]一直希望我的生活不会只剩下忙碌的工作……[r][l]我的意思是，自从我来到营地之后，虽然闲得让我不太适应……但、我倒不讨厌。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"不近人情"}